OL,3,GNEWSAThe clinic using AI to detect skin
OL,4,Acancer earlier
OL,5,
OL,6,FStaff at an NHS clinic using artificial
OL,7,Fintelligence (AI) to detect skin cancer
OL,8,Fsooner have said the technology could
OL,9,Fbe a "game changer".
OL,11,FThe dermatology team at St Luke's
OL,12,FHospital in Bradford adopted the new
OL,13,Fsystem in April to examine suspicious
OL,14,Fskin lesions.
OL,16,FThe quick scanning means that 32
OL,17,Fpatients can be seen in each session,
OL,18,Fcompared to 24 before AI was
OL,19,Fintroduced.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
