OL,3,GNEWSAThe clinic using AI to detect skin
OL,4,Acancer earlier
OL,5,
OL,6,FConsultant plastic surgeon Mr Zakir
OL,7,FShariff said the technology has had a
OL,8,F"big impact" on waiting times and the
OL,9,Fnumber of unnecessary procedures.
